{
  "slug": "showcase",
  "title": "Cutroom showcase",
  "header": "一个视频看完[[全部效果]]",
  "headerEn": "Every effect in one video",
  "fps": 60,
  "theme": {
    "accent": "#3b6ef5",
    "accent2": "#8fb0ff",
    "bg": [
      "#0b1020",
      "#1a2140"
    ]
  },
  "music": {
    "src": "music/aerosol-of-my-love.mp3",
    "volume": 0.3,
    "duck": 0.5
  },
  "frame": {
    "radius": 22,
    "shadow": 1.2
  },
  "glass": true,
  "chapterBar": true,
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "chapter": "开场",
      "lines": [
        {
          "zh": "录一遍产品，剩下的[[和 AI 一起剪]]。",
          "en": "Film your product once, then cut it together with an AI."
        }
      ],
      "visual": {
        "kind": "title",
        "kicker": "Cutroom",
        "title": "录下产品，[[和 AI]] 一起剪",
        "sub": "改版了就重录，剪辑跟着素材走"
      },
      "fx": {
        "vignette": 0.35,
        "grain": 0.2
      },
      "overlays": [
        {
          "kind": "image",
          "src": "media/badge-new.png",
          "at": 0.4,
          "dur": 4,
          "x": 0.82,
          "y": 0.24,
          "w": 0.16,
          "enter": "spin",
          "rot": -10,
          "float": true
        }
      ],
      "tall": {
        "kind": "title",
        "kicker": "录下产品",
        "title": "[[和 AI]] 一起剪",
        "sub": "改版了就重录，剪辑跟着素材走"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "record",
      "chapter": "录屏",
      "transition": "dip",
      "transDur": 0.7,
      "lines": [
        {
          "zh": "录屏会[[跟着点击]]自动推近。",
          "en": "Screen recordings zoom in on every click.",
          "at": "@type-0.3"
        },
        {
          "zh": "光标、点击涟漪，都是后期加上去的。",
          "en": "The cursor and click ripples are added afterwards.",
          "at": "@check-0.2"
        }
      ],
      "visual": {
        "kind": "screen",
        "src": "cap/planner.mp4",
        "from": 0.8,
        "url": "planner.example",
        "to": "@filter+1.2"
      },
      "overlays": [
        {
          "kind": "arrow",
          "at": 3.6,
          "dur": 1.8,
          "text": "自动推近",
          "x": 0.62,
          "y": 0.36,
          "w": 0.14,
          "h": 0.16
        }
      ],
      "sounds": [
        {
          "id": "pop",
          "at": 3.6,
          "vol": 0.8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "photo",
      "chapter": "图片",
      "transition": "flip",
      "transDir": "right",
      "lines": [
        {
          "zh": "一张图，加上慢推、暖色和漏光，就动起来了。",
          "en": "A still gets a slow push, a warm look and a light leak."
        }
      ],
      "visual": {
        "kind": "image",
        "src": "media/lake.jpg"
      },
      "fx": {
        "kenburns": "in",
        "kbAmount": 0.16,
        "look": "warm",
        "leak": 0.6,
        "vignette": 0.4
      },
      "overlays": [
        {
          "kind": "lower",
          "at": 0.5,
          "dur": 2.6,
          "text": "Ken Burns",
          "sub": "慢推 · 暖色 · 漏光"
        }
      ],
      "sounds": [
        {
          "id": "shutter",
          "at": 0.15
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clip",
      "transition": "clock",
      "lines": [
        {
          "zh": "视频片段加上黑边和胶片颗粒，马上有电影感。",
          "en": "Letterbox and film grain make any clip feel cinematic."
        }
      ],
      "visual": {
        "kind": "clip",
        "src": "media/desert.mp4",
        "fit": "cover"
      },
      "fx": {
        "letterbox": 0.1,
        "grain": 0.45,
        "look": "teal"
      },
      "overlays": [
        {
          "kind": "cinema",
          "at": 0.3,
          "dur": 2.6,
          "text": "CINEMA",
          "sub": "letterbox · grain · look"
        }
      ],
      "sounds": [
        {
          "id": "boom",
          "at": 0.3,
          "vol": 0.8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "numbers",
      "chapter": "数据",
      "transition": "slide",
      "transDir": "down",
      "lines": [
        {
          "zh": "三十九种转场，三十三种文字动画，四十一种叠加。",
          "en": "39 transitions, 33 text animations, 41 overlays."
        }
      ],
      "visual": {
        "kind": "stats",
        "items": [
          {
            "value": "39",
            "label": "种转场",
            "en": "transitions"
          },
          {
            "value": "33",
            "label": "种文字动画",
            "en": "text animations"
          },
          {
            "value": "41",
            "label": "种叠加元素",
            "en": "overlays"
          }
        ]
      },
      "sounds": [
        {
          "id": "hit",
          "at": 0.25,
          "vol": 0.7
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "how",
      "transition": "push",
      "lines": [
        {
          "zh": "你在界面里拖，AI 用命令行改，[[改的是同一份文件]]。",
          "en": "You drag in the UI, the AI edits through the CLI, both on the same file."
        }
      ],
      "visual": {
        "kind": "flow",
        "title": "一份分镜，两个编辑者",
        "cols": [
          [
            {
              "label": "你",
              "sub": "拖动 · 裁切 · 调参数"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "label": "storyboard.json",
              "sub": "实时同步"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "label": "AI 助手",
              "sub": "一句话改"
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "loop",
      "chapter": "重录",
      "transition": "fade",
      "lines": [
        {
          "zh": "界面改版了，[[重录一遍]]，字幕跟着标记走。",
          "en": "When the app changes, run the recording again. The captions follow the marks."
        }
      ],
      "visual": {
        "kind": "html",
        "src": "scenes/loop/index.html",
        "vars": {
          "title": "产品改版了？重录一遍就行",
          "step1": "录屏",
          "note1": "每次点击和标记都记下来",
          "step2": "和 AI 一起剪",
          "note2": "字幕挂在标记上",
          "step3": "重新录制",
          "note3": "剪辑跟着新素材走"
        }
      },
      "tall": {
        "kind": "html",
        "src": "scenes/loop/tall.html",
        "vars": {
          "title": "产品改版了？重录一遍就行",
          "step1": "录屏",
          "note1": "每次点击和标记都记下来",
          "step2": "和 AI 一起剪",
          "note2": "字幕挂在标记上",
          "step3": "重新录制",
          "note3": "剪辑跟着新素材走"
        }
      },
      "minSec": 4.5
    },
    {
      "id": "outro",
      "chapter": "结尾",
      "transition": "zoom",
      "tail": 1.4,
      "lines": [
        {
          "zh": "开源，欢迎试用。",
          "en": "It's open source. Give it a try."
        }
      ],
      "visual": {
        "kind": "outro",
        "title": "Cutroom",
        "url": "github.com/WEBGRS/cutroom",
        "lines": [
          "MIT · Remotion · React"
        ]
      },
      "fx": {
        "fadeOut": 1.2
      },
      "sounds": [
        {
          "id": "ding",
          "at": 0.8,
          "vol": 0.8
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}